Eminent domain energy collector systems
HB0091
amendments.
Sponsored By: Joint Agriculture, State and Public Lands & Water
Resources Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to eminent domain; repealing the ability of entities who are
not public utilities to use the right of condemnation for electric generation
collector systems; providing requirements for existing easements; requiring
condemnors to give notice to local governing bodies before commencement of a
condemnation action; specifying requirements for condemnation actions;
specifying applicability; and providing for an effective date.
